      {
        "en": "Yes, there is a shop, a supermarket, and a department store.",
        "zh": "有，有一間商店、一家超級市場和一家百貨公司。"
      },
      {
        "en": "I often go to the library to read books.",
        "zh": "我常去圖書館看書。"
      },
      {
        "en": "On Saturdays, my family goes to the market to buy fresh vegetables.",
        "zh": "週六，我的家人會去市場買新鮮蔬菜。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We also visit the theater to watch a movie.",
        "zh": "我們也會去劇院看電影。"
      },
      {
        "en": "If someone feels sick, we can go to the hospital.",
        "zh": "如果有人感到不適，我們可以去醫院。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My uncle works in a factory that makes toys.",
        "zh": "我的叔叔在一間製造玩具的工廠工作。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Look at the map of Taiwan; you can see Taipei, New Taipei, Beitou, Taoyuan, Taichung, Tainan, and Kaohsiung.",
        "zh": "看看台灣的地圖，你可以看到台北、新北、北投、桃園、台中、台南和高雄。"
      }
